  "title": "Delicious Pumpkin Bread",
  "description": "Pumpkin bread made with fresh pumpkin and walnuts (or raisins!) is perfectly spiced for breakfast or snacking. This easy recipe makes three loaves!",
  "authors": [
    "Vicki Monte"
  ],
